        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production GQ, at evaporation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production GQ, at evaporation plant
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=8d5e2ecc-1405-39b3-bb67-ef440991ee5e
This dataset describes the gasification of Equatorial Guinean natural gas in a Polish evaporation plant.
Location: Global data for energy requirements combined and natural gas characteristics. 
Technology: European technology average.
Time period: Data on energy use for the evaporation stems of a review of common technologies from 2017 and 2019.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8d5e2ecc-1405-39b3-bb67-ef440991ee5e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
